{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想把會議、課堂或語音備忘錄快速整理成文字，Voice Notes 正是為此而設的轉錄工具。它適合需要記錄會議、課堂、訪談、影片與口頭靈感的使用者，可錄音或匯入音訊與影片，轉成可編輯、可搜尋的逐字稿。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>錄音與匯入皆可轉文字</h2>\n<p>Voice Notes 把語音變成可搜尋的文字。你可直接錄音，或從相片、檔案匯入音訊與影片，亦可貼上直接的 HTTPS 媒體連結轉錄。完成後可邊播放邊核對逐字稿，手動修正並重新命名，再按標題或內容搜尋，並匯出 TXT 或 PDF。轉錄前可選語言，無需帳號，資料只在本機處理。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-224-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-225-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-226-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-227-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-228-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Voice Notes : Voice to Text</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-02T06:18:29.760062+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":330,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}